# Resto do repositório AI-MODELFILES, declarado abandonado (achado G-50 da revisão de
# 01/09/2026). Estava registrado como **gitlink** (modo 160000) sem `.gitmodules`: um
# `git clone` criava a pasta VAZIA, e o conteúdo local era invisível ao git de fora.
#
# Medido antes de tirar: os **onze** Modelfiles dali já existem neste repositório, byte a
# byte (`modelfiles/archive/`, `modelfiles/shana/`, `modelfiles/tools/`). Únicos eram só o
# `README.md` e o `version.md` — do OUTRO repo. Remover o ponteiro não perdeu nada.
#
# A pasta continua no disco de quem já a tinha; apagá-la é decisão do dono.
#
# 🔴 Measured 2026-09-22: the sentence above says the pointer was removed. It was NOT.
# `IA-MODELFILES` stayed in the index as a GITLINK (mode 160000, commit b4444142) with no
# `.gitmodules` to map it, so every `git submodule` command in this repository failed:
#
#     $ git submodule status
#     fatal: no submodule mapping found in .gitmodules for path 'IA-MODELFILES'
#
# A fresh `git clone --recurse-submodules` succeeded but created an EMPTY
# `IA-MODELFILES/` directory and then failed the same way. `.gitignore` never had a say:
# it does not apply to a path already tracked, and `git status` stays silent because a
# gitlink whose commit matches the index reports nothing. Dropped from the index in
# 1.2.11 — the on-disk folder was not touched.
IA-MODELFILES/
